{"slug":"twig-ex-atex","title":"Twig Ex","desc":"The TWIG EX is an safe and highly durable SOS alarm that is ATEX/IECEX approved that protects lone workers operating within a hazardous environment.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"ATEX Lone Worker Device\",\"title\":\"Twig Ex\",\"intro\":\"Give your team an intrinsically safe device that is ATEX/IECEX approved.\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eBS 8484:2022 accredited for lone working\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSOS alarm with 24/7 support\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSecured by Design approved\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"SOS Alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Help available 24/7\",\"heading\":\"SOS Alarm\",\"content\":\"Receive emergency help faster than 999 with direct access to police control rooms.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"IP67-rated\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Waterproof.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Waterproof and dustproof\",\"heading\":\"IP67-rated\",\"content\":\"IP67-rated robust casing makes Twig Ex durable and reduces the need to replace damaged devices. Protection against dust, rain, splashing and accidental submersion for 30 minutes in up to 1 metre of water.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"ATEX Approved\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/ATEX.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Safety in hazardous environments\",\"heading\":\"ATEX Approved\",\"content\":\"Designed to be used in all hazardous and potentially explosive environments.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Fall Detection\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/fall-detection.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Raise an alarm hands-free\",\"heading\":\"Fall Detection\",\"content\":\"Automatic alarm raised when a fall is detected. Staff can get help when they may be incapacitated and unable to press the SOS button.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Heat resistant\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/heat-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Works in all weathers\",\"heading\":\"Heat resistant\",\"content\":\"Able to withstand temperatures from -20°C to 40°C.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC). We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Functional in every environment\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Twig-ATEX-1024x682.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Along with two-way audio, GPS and Fall Detection capabilities, the TWIG Ex device also features pre-defined buttons for voice calls and a dedicated button to raise an alarm in an emergency. As it’s ATEX rated, it’s designed to be used in all hazardous environments, including explosive areas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Certified to <a href=\"/uk/accreditations/bs-8484/\">BS 8484:2022</a> and NPCC’s coveted ‘Secured by Design’ accolade, the Twig Ex is fully compatible with our lone worker monitoring software. Our intuitive, online portal will help you monitor and review how employees interact with their Twig devices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Designed to withstand the most extreme conditions, the TWIG Ex is essential for those working in high-risk environments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/14/3/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the Twig Ex can enhance the safety and security of your workers in explosive and volatile areas?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how Twig Ex provides reliable protection and a professional response to ensure your employees are protected with an intrinsically safe device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/14/3/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a Twig Ex demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-16/2jj3qv\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Related Products\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:standard-mobile@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":12,"types":["safety-devices"]}